+
+  // No FIFO-depth wait here. We can get away with this today due to the following:
+  // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+  // ==> Legacy alone: mm_in_flight ≤ max_cmds_in_flight = 12, num_wcmds = 1 per
+  // matmul → up to 12 wcmds in flight.
+  // ==> HW-attn alone: mm_in_flight ≤ 1, num_wcmds = 2 × nshards × B. With B=1
+  // (asserted in prepare_hwattn_cmds) and nshards ≤ MAX_B = 32 (asserted in
